# Verifies: SPEC §1, §13
# Contrasts that `ybm check` only type-checks doc test blocks without running them,
# while `ybm test` actually runs them and can therefore detect this assert failure.
# The square doc block is correct as a type (int == int comparison), but
# fails at runtime: assert(square(3) == 100) does not hold (square(3) is 9).

## Returns n squared.
##
## ```
## assert(square(3) == 100)
## ```
def square(n: int): int
    return n * n
